# Results and scope

The fixture returned draft, copyedit, illustrate, then assemble. The alternative order with illustration first is valid after drafting because the two tasks are independent. The cyclic pair raised `ValueError`. The replay writes the order and cycle result to a local JSON record and draws the order shown below.

![One valid ordering of a fictional publishing checklist.](../../output/figures/publishing_order.png){#fig:publishing-order}

The results describe the graph utility on this fixture. They give no evidence about task execution, an external service, or the behavior of a larger workflow.
